{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And the booty, the remainder of the spoil.</b> Since they were not commanded to raise a levy from the movable goods but only from the booty, it wrote this expression — <b>ויהי המלקוח</b> — which comes to include both the portion and the levy: that which remained over and above the spoil of the movable goods, <b>which the soldiers had plundered, each man for himself</b> — and does not come to include the portion, the count of the sheep, etc."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:28.965241316Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}